{"id":407,"flavor":[{"games":["Legends: Arceus"],"text":"Hidden within the bouquet on each hand are thorned whips loaded with virulent poison. Roserade moves gracefully as it corners its prey and mercilessly lashes them with its whips."},{"games":["Shield"],"text":"The poison in its right hand is quick acting. The poison in its left hand is slow acting. Both are life threatening."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"After captivating opponents with its sweet scent, it lashes them with its thorny whips."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Y","Pearl"],"text":"With the movements of a dancer, it strikes with whips that are densely lined with poison thorns."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","X","White 2","Black 2"],"text":"Luring prey with a sweet scent, it uses poison whips on its arms to poison, bind, and finish off the prey."},{"games":["White","Black","Platinum"],"text":"Each of its hands contains different toxins, but both hands can jab with near-fatal power."},{"games":["SoulSilver","HeartGold"],"text":"Its sweet aroma attracts prey. Then it spews poison. The more toxic it is, the sweeter its aroma."},{"games":["Diamond"],"text":"It attracts prey with a sweet aroma, then downs it with thorny whips hidden in its arms."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Natural Cure","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon's status conditions are cured when it switches out."},{"name":"Poison Point","hidden":false,"description":"Contact with the Pokémon may poison the attacker."},{"name":"Technician","hidden":true,"description":"Powers up weak moves so the Pokémon can deal more damage with them."}],"eggGroups":["Fairy","Grass"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium slow","habitat":null,"color":"Green","shape":"Humanoid","evolution":{"id":406,"name":"Budew","condition":null,"children":[{"id":315,"name":"Roselia","condition":"Level up, High Friendship (Day)","children":[{"id":407,"name":"Roserade","condition":"Use Shiny Stone","children":[]}]}]},"moves":{"game":"Sword / Shield","lev